# Files EAS should not upload into the build archive.
# None of these are needed to build; they were adding ~hundreds of MB to
# every upload. See docs/APP_STORE.md housekeeping note.
#
# THIS FILE REPLACES .gitignore FOR EAS, it does not add to it. Anything
# gitignored but not listed here is still uploaded, which is why the archive
# kept growing after this file was created: the two `_src` trees below are
# generation-size originals that the install scripts read from, they are out of
# the repo, and EAS was shipping all 72 MB of them to the builder every time.
.history/
dist/
.expo-export-check/
.expo-export-check*/
assets/character/_src/
assets/art/rank/_src/
